:: mc-portrait-system [script nobr]
/*
  MC PORTRAIT MANAGER
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  The actual state->filename logic lives in
  window.getPortraitForState() (src/ui/script.js), and the
  <<updatePortrait>> widget that applies it to $mcPortrait
  lives in src/ui/widgets.tw. Call <<updatePortrait>> at the
  end of any passage where stress, day number, or gamePath
  changes in a way that should update the right-sidebar
  portrait.

  This file is reserved for portrait logic that outgrows a
  single function   e.g. outfit-layered portraits, expression
  variants keyed off $arousal, or per-scene portrait overrides.
*/
